  "subtitle": "Main flow: local preview → authorized QR download → cached or rendered PNG/SVG.",
  "classNote": "QR encodes the stable affiliate short URL with via=qr. Preview is generated in Browser; imported rendering functions and support-access audit details are documented separately.",
  "notes": [
    "Browser = ReferralLinksPage + useQrDataUrl + HTTP adapter. JWT and role guards precede the controller; KOL downloads their own link. API inline preview is a separate 60/minute path.",
    "Cache hit reuses the image; only cache miss renders/writes cache. PNG uses renderQrPng; SVG uses QRCode.toString and sanitization. Invalid options, ownership or rate-limit checks stop the request.",
    "Cache TTL is 86400 seconds. Redis download counter and Shop/Admin support audit are summarized in FR11_CODE_ANALYSIS.md. Generating/downloading a QR records no affiliate click."
  ],
